1:# attach to a process and mess with a variable, breaking out of a loop
2:maint set sync on

4:attach $a %%appid%%

6:break 20

8:# climp up to main- the depth we will get stopped at can vary, so be excessive...
9:up
10:up
11:up
12:up
13:up

15:# beacon for text matching
16:maint echo beacon

18:# change argc, which will break us out of the loop
19:assign argc 999

21:# continue to line 20
22:c

24:p argc

26:q
